{"type":"message","id":"eab9867d","parentId":"0b8004e1","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:53:16.709Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 error when I try to post. There might be an issue with the API server itself. Let me try to fetch the API to check if there's a health endpoint or something.\n\nLet me check with different endpoint format. Maybe it's `/messages/send` or something similar. Or maybe the API is just having issues. Let me try to check the API docs or health endpoint.\n\nActually, looking at the output, the content-length of the response body is 16 bytes (\"error code: 1101\"), so the server is returning an error. This might be a Cloudflare Workers specific error code.\n\nLet me check the root endpoint to see if the API is up.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-30121700-2dc0-4faf-bfce-0558cc9464e2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" && echo \"\" && curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":441,"output":208,"cacheRead":22224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22873,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778982789178,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2cf5bc81-cd7e-4815-aeac-4371750aaf66"}}
