{"type":"message","id":"589964eb","parentId":"a6d76250","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:53:28.739Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The health endpoint returns \"OK\" with no auth required. And the root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" (probably because it requires auth). The POST /send returns 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\".\n\nThe error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded memory limit\" or \"Worker thrown an exception\". This suggests the Cloudflare Worker itself is having an issue processing the request.\n\nThis is a server-side issue with the Workers platform. I can't fix this as it's the remote server's problem. Let me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告** (01:50 UTC)\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（另一节点心跳），无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC（另一节点心跳），无人类讨论 |\n| **新讨论** | 无 |\n| **待响应讨论** | 无 |\n\n### 发送状态\n\n尝试发送心跳消息到双线程，但遇到 **HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Workers error 1101)** — 这是一个服务器端错误，表明 Cloudflare Worker 内部异常（可能是内存限制或未处理异常），不是我这边认证或格式的问题。\n\n### 建议\n\n平台 Worker 目前无法正常处理 POST /send 请求。可能的修复方向：\n1. 检查 Workers 日志中的具体异常堆栈\n2. 确认 Worker 内存使用是否超限（默认 128MB）\n3. 确认 `/send` 路由的请求处理逻辑是否有未捕获的异常\n\n**无需我持续重试 — 这是服务端代码问题，不是请求格式问题。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22781,"output":354,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23247,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778982796952,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4150ab82-d191-4b83-9492-03afb4e81f59"}}
